api.github.com/repos/LNXSeus/Advancely/releases/assets/447606571","id":447606571,"node_id":"RA_kwDOPBIzzs4are8r","name":"Advancely-v1.5.3-macOS-Universal.zip","label":null,"uploader":{"login":"LNXSeus","id":163330291,"node_id":"U_kgDOCbw48w","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/163330291?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LNXSeus","html_url":"https://github.com/LNXSeus","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LNXSeus/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LNXSeus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LNXSeus/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LNXSeus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LNXSeus/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LNXSeus/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LNXSeus/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LNXSeus/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LNXSeus/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/x-zip-compressed","state":"uploaded","size":123515951,"digest":"sha256:79a2fdda892fb2f5c12c21a3e672b4f94b85dd51c172b49d0f8872d64dcda8da","download_count":4,"created_at":"2026-06-14T22:31:38Z","updated_at":"2026-06-14T22:32:54Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/LNXSeus/Advancely/releases/download/v1.5.3/Advancely-v1.5.3-macOS-Universal.zip"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LNXSeus/Advancely/releases/assets/447607071","id":447607071,"node_id":"RA_kwDOPBIzzs4arfEf","name":"Advancely-v1.5.3-Windows.zip","label":null,"uploader":{"login":"LNXSeus","id":163330291,"node_id":"U_kgDOCbw48w","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/163330291?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LNXSeus","html_url":"https://github.com/LNXSeus","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LNXSeus/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LNXSeus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LNXSeus/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LNXSeus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LNXSeus/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LNXSeus/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LNXSeus/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LNXSeus/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LNXSeus/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/x-zip-compressed","state":"uploaded","size":118584632,"digest":"sha256:04a8b4683e2a5953e164372269f831b13f4ef7fc1003f7520134487ab776ee99","download_count":49,"created_at":"2026-06-14T22:32:54Z","updated_at":"2026-06-14T22:34:00Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/LNXSeus/Advancely/releases/download/v1.5.3/Advancely-v1.5.3-Windows.zip"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LNXSeus/Advancely/tarball/v1.5.3","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LNXSeus/Advancely/zipball/v1.5.3","body":"#### This update finally separates `_layout` files from the main template files and incorporates them in a similar fashion as the `_lang` files. This means the same template can now have different layouts similar to languages. This release also adds **Settings Presets** and some more features into the **Template Editor**.\r\n\r\n## More features and additions include, but are not limited to:\r\n\r\n- New Layout dropdown in both the settings panel and the template editor.\r\n- Editing a template within the Editor automatically selects that template within the settings to always be in sync.\r\n- Create / copy / import / export / delete flows all respect layout files now.\r\n- The template currently in use **can** be deleted (it falls back to the default template), same for language and layout file deletions.\r\n- Language and layout imports reject the wrong `.json` files, and positioning counters now correctly trigger the `(has layout)` flag.\r\n- `Restart Advancely` button now only exists on Windows as it didn't fully function on other OS. Warnings have been adjusted to mention a manual restart.\r\n\r\n### Settings Presets\r\n\r\n- Save named settings configurations and switch between them.\r\n- Settings file read/write is centralized into one function to prevent corruption and partial reads (keeps a backup of the prior state).\r\n- Multiple Advancely instances can no longer run at the same time.\r\n\r\n### Template editor\r\n\r\n- New Invert Selection bulk action.\r\n- Selected goals within the Visual Layout Editor directly be added as linked goals.\r\n- Arrow keys nudge the current selection in the Visual Layout Editor.\r\n- You're kicked out of that editor if no saves folder is tracked.\r\n- Re-selecting an already-selected item deselects it.\r\n- Goals can be imported from unzipped (unpacked) templates, not just zipped ones.\r\n- Copying a template into a new version selects that version afterward in the Editor's version dropdown.\r\n\r\n### Coop\r\n\r\n- Heartbeat hardening for more reliable coop syncing.\r\n- A coop lobby can no longer be started while the template editor is open -> corrected disabled tooltip.\r\n- Warning above Start Lobby noting that certain options can't be changed once hosting.\r\n\r\n### Auto-updater\r\n\r\n- Uses proper rendering and is now fully automatic after confirming once (No more clicking OK 3 times, lol).\r\n<img width=\"542\" height=\"570\" alt=\"Automatic_Updating_v1 5 3\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6dd617d2-edf8-4fad-b39d-608172bc8f69\" />\r\n<img width=\"520\" height=\"108\" alt=\"Automatic_Updating_v1 5 3_2\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8f236eda-1b87-4829-8998-39540ed7b32a\" />\r\n\r\n\r\n### Templates added\r\n\r\n- `1.16.1` `all_advancements` `_ssg_blackcat` by [ErchamionMC](https://www.twitch.tv/erchamionmc)\r\n<img width=\"1422\" height=\"1386\" alt=\"SSG Blackcat Template\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/fb8361ee-3410-478b-bb25-f4e9d9a47fc9\" />\r\n\r\n- `1.16.1` `all_blocks` by [magnissima](https://www.twitch.tv/magnissima)\r\n<img width=\"2193\" height=\"1165\" alt=\"All Blocks Template\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a0a3ff27-4fb0-45dc-b310-15179225a795\" />\r\n\r\n\r\n- `26.1` `all_advancements` `_aatool_optimized` by [Zesskyo](https://www.twitch.tv/zesskyo)\r\n<img width=\"1847\" height=\"1231\" alt=\"26 1 AATool Optimized Template\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8fc66e64-8ce4-4056-a661-05d8398881f0\" />\r\n\r\n\r\n- `26.2` `all_advancements` `_aatool_optimized` by Zesskyo and then refined my me\r\n<img width=\"1823\" height=\"1300\" alt=\"26 2 AATool Optimized Template\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ca0db400-efd4-40ca-bbcd-dc01ae89b2e2\" />\r\n\r\n_These screenshots use the MSYHBD.TTC font._\r\n\r\n### Templates modified\r\n\r\n- `1.21` `all_trims`: added a counter\r\n- `26.1` `all_advancements` `_categorical`\r\n- `26.2` `all_advancements` `_categorical`\r\n\r\n-----\r\n\r\n> Find more info on the [tracker main page](https://github.com/LNXSeus/Advancely)!\r\n\r\n-----\r\n\r\n## *[Donations](https://streamlabs.com/lnxseus/tip) are always welcome\\! Make sure to mention `Advancely` in the donation message.*\r\n\r\nEnjoy the update\\!"}